.dw.com/en/german-churches-speak-out-against-afd-ahead-of-state-election/a-78482465?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the far-right AfD party leads the polls ahead of Sunday's election in Saxony-Anhalt, church leaders have warned against downplaying its "ethnonationalist" agenda.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>EU wants drones to spray pesticides, but it could backfire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7fc9548ff55a8484c2094c617d5311d197e114a0e1f895568ab44246ecb68dbb</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T15:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-wants-drones-to-spray-pesticides-but-it-could-backfire/a-78557154--b8aa3ba6b326.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-wants-drones-to-spray-pesticides-but-it-could-backfire/a-78557154?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The EU wants to lift a decades-old ban on spraying pesticides from the air, allowing drones to be used for greater precision. But experts warn the plan could lead to even more pesticides being used in agriculture.</summary><category term="Science" /></entry><entry><title>Greece, Turkey clash over protected Aegean marine areas</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:96483ef5330a65520d197b61b63ebb718bab330b776cc939318c8bb29f78f54f</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T09:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/greece-turkey-clash-over-protected-aegean-marine-areas/a-78550021--ccf9d418d0a0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/greece-turkey-clash-over-protected-aegean-marine-areas/a-78550021?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Turkey has announced the creation of two protected zones in a disputed area of the Aegean Sea, sparking an angry reaction from Greece. Does this mark a new chapter in a long-running dispute between the two countries?</summary>