2470?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's men's ice hockey team has appointed a new head coach following a string of dissappointing tournaments. He's two decades younger than the man he's replacing but he has no previous experience as a head coach.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>New study shows German football remains male-dominated</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c5638d23fcd02ab4461f7b151a4758f2bdc66e36563d597d41963035c6bf267b</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T13:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-study-shows-german-football-remains-male-dominated/a-78532569--b9ee319bf21e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-study-shows-german-football-remains-male-dominated/a-78532569?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The top leagues of German football remain a largely male environment. A new study reveals that only seven clubs have women in upper management levels.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Ex-Bosnian Serb military leader Ratko Mladic dead at 84</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52a13abeb75e8a57039dfa1024f96ea10742a145779c4a9d799a61719b7148f1</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T12:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ex-bosnian-serb-military-leader-ratko-mladic-dead-at-84/a-78531323--06031b46eb88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ex-bosnian-serb-military-leader-ratko-mladic-dead-at-84/a-78531323?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The former Bosnian Serb general was convicted of genocide committed during the bloody 1992-95 war in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Venus' US Open invitation raises questions about wild cards</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:deb2508323879902f3e6beed31182792205eb1fbe51611eb275d56014b8