rs are proving that recovery is still within reach.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Why social media addiction is so hard to regulate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:334c75cda323af3af88b2013735a28a4aa2ff0eeccd07d72b8fbd503b3a01010</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T09:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023--933d64d6576a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-social-media-addiction-is-so-hard-to-regulate/a-78482023?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Facebook, Instagram and other social media platforms are accused of deliberately fostering addictive behavior among young users. Yet regulators continue to struggle to rein in their engagement-driven business models.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>CDU's Volkmann: Ukraine aid is not charity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b7bf7a3612e3736f54ff180a55629086be81d1fb5d17ffabe2bf6b25f43d7e75</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T08:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cdu-s-volkmann-ukraine-aid-is-not-charity/a-78517659--5ee5d4723ed5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cdu-s-volkmann-ukraine-aid-is-not-charity/a-78517659?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Former German Chancellor Helmut Kohl's grandson Johannes Volkmann spoke to DW about why Germany must continue to support Ukraine.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Bundesliga season 2026-27: All you need to know</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:26cdc3119b8cc56932a1bf407988671df0aaff9b799cc33bd5de7dd884a12436</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T06:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bundesliga-season-2026-27-all-you-need-to-know/a-78061925--f39290153444.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bundesliga-season-2026-27-all-you-need-to-know/a-78061925?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From key dates to rising football stars and changes, DW has the latest on the new Bundesliga season.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Japanese artist Yayoi Kusama dies at 97</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:532a4beca60ceaaa76b9bf34c2892166f9b0ede3e7a7a11505c450228750dc33</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T02:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japanese-artist-yayoi-kusama-dies-at-97/a-78518473--ef335263e2f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japanese-artist-yayoi-kusama-dies-at-97/a-78518473?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From works of "self-obliteration" to polka dotted nudes, the pioneering artist developed a unique body of work likely to be relevant for years to come.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Was the heat of this summer really 'normal?'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:27ac34d2fa73b08ff196585398e8351d9b41b01a9bd75af436dfee943430a9fa</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T16:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/was-the-heat-of-this-summer-really-normal/a-78513682--d3f656ecebd2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/was-the-heat-of-this-summer-really-normal/a-78513682?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Some political messaging denies the role of human-caused climate change in this summer's extreme heat. The science tells a different story.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Tim Curry, of 'The Rocky Horror Picture Show,' dies at 80</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bb5ab186676d413db75cf62c4ddfecd13c6ba46ceed030a663526ff2ea2e5f95</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><publi